WEBVTT

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.060
It must have been a dream

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.860
I couldn't tell what time it was

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.740
Couldn't seem to breathe

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.640
But it still felt like me

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.340
At least it looked like you

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.900
Remember all the things we used to do

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.020
Once again, they're coming true

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:22.780
Mr. Know-It-All, why'd you let it fall?

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.820
It's a bad idea to just disappear

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.900
Running towards your voice

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.980
As if I even had a choice

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.160
I had to see your smile

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.080
Ran for what seemed like miles

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.900
Walked for what seemed like days

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.920
Just getting further and

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:01.920
Further and further and further away, oh

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:05.060
It's time to let it go

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.020
Just let it be a ghost

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.420
Haunting me in my sleep

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.620
But first I need to know

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.420
Tell me all your plans

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.180
Anything that you can

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.640
To keep me in, so far from you

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.740
So tell me what you meant

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:30.740
Mr. Know-It-All, why'd you let it fall?

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:41.200
It's a bad idea to just disappear
